<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81280" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδρομ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running round, encircling</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				20
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάναι καὶ -δρομαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.493d
				</span></i>
			, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ποιεῖσθαι</span> wheel
			about, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				10.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>revolution</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδρομαὶ ἐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					776
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a military
			manoeuvre, = Lat. <i>decursio</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιωτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					76.15
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐνόπλιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					77.16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ περιδρομήν</span>
			<i>cursorily</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				20.12.1
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>getting round, cajolery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Memn.
				8.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.415.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.
			θεραπείας</span>, = Lat. <i>ambitus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				78.22
			</span></i>.</div>
